WEBVTT

1
00:00:08,660 --> 00:00:09,560
One night

2
00:00:09,860 --> 00:00:11,140
Why hasn't the fever gone down at all?

3
00:00:20,310 --> 00:00:21,310
Wei Shui cannot withstand the wetness

4
00:00:21,590 --> 00:00:22,510
What she needs is medicine

5
00:00:23,030 --> 00:00:29,060
Sister Weiwei, where did you go to find so many grasses on the medicine mountain?

6
00:00:29,060 --> 00:00:30,100
There is always something that can reduce fever

7
00:00:30,460 --> 00:00:35,210
Can you tell the difference between poisonous herbs and herbs? Wei was wrong. She didn't die from the illness.

8
00:00:35,610 --> 00:00:36,570
I'll be poisoned by you first

9
00:00:36,770 --> 00:00:37,810
What do you think we should do?

10
00:00:38,450 --> 00:00:42,610
Did you watch her burn to death? My coat

11
00:00:43,090 --> 00:00:44,050
Give it to Sister Yao too

12
00:00:45,220 --> 00:00:46,540
How many days has it been?

13
00:00:47,060 --> 00:00:48,300
Can Sister Yao survive this?

14
00:00:49,650 --> 00:00:50,810
We can't talk about this

15
00:00:53,050 --> 00:00:55,810
Did Teacher Jiang ask?

16
00:00:55,810 --> 00:00:57,940
Just hot water and salt won't do the trick

17
00:01:00,710 --> 00:01:11,180
Brother Lin Feng, if you continue to waste money like this?

18
00:01:11,620 --> 00:01:16,670
Even if you don't die, you still have to leave behind the root of the disease. Don't stop.

19
00:01:16,910 --> 00:01:17,830
Everyone goes to fetch water
